p autumn evening, and the air was filled with the promise of new beginnings."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 252, "end": 473, "text": "Among the sea of students hurrying to their evening classes, one figure stood out - Yibing Maxine Tan, her dark hair tied back in a neat ponytail, her eyes shining with an intensity that hinted at a mind always in motion."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 474, "end": 548, "text": "Maxine, as she preferred to be called, had always been drawn to the stars."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 549, "end": 671, "text": "As a child, she would spend hours gazing up at the night sky, dreaming of the day she could soar among the constellations."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 672, "end": 855, "text": "It was this passion that had led her to pursue a degree in aeronautics and astronautics at the University of Washington, where she had honed her skills and earned her Master's degree."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 856, "end": 1014, "text": "But before that, Maxine had spent four formative years at Lawrence University, where she had discovered the beauty of music and the power of the human spirit."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1015, "end": 1207, "text": "It was here, surrounded by the charming Victorian-era buildings and the tranquil Fox River, that she had found her voice - not just as a scientist, but as a creative force to be reckoned with."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1208, "end": 1477, "text": "As she walked across campus, the sounds of the conservatory's evening concert wafted through the air, transporting her back to a time when she would sneak into the chapel to play the grand piano, her fingers dancing across the keys as she poured her heart out in music."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1478, "end": 1605, "text": "It was a secret she had kept from her classmates, but one that had brought her solace during the long, grueling hours of study."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1606, "end": 1757, "text": "Maxine's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of laughter and chatter, as a group of students spilled out of the music building, instruments in hand."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1758, "end": 1879, "text": "Among them was her old friend, Rachel, a violinist with a wild mane of curly hair and a smile that could light up a room."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1880, "end": 2013, "text": "The two exchanged a warm hug, and Maxine couldn't help but feel a pang of nostalgia for the carefree days of her undergraduate years."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2014, "end": 2167, "text": "As they caught up on old times, Maxine's mind began to wander back to her current project - designing a new propulsion system for deep space exploration."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2168, "end": 2294, "text": "She knew it was a long shot, but she was driven by a fierce determination to push the boundaries of what was thought possible."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Lawrence University", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "University of Washington", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Yibing Maxine Tan", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Yibing Maxine Tan spent four formative years at Lawrence University.", "answer": "Lawrence University", "quote": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Appleton, Wisconsin, the campus of Lawrence University came alive with the sweet melodies of strings and woodwinds. It was a crisp autumn evening, and the air was filled with the promise of new beginnings. Among the sea of students hurrying to their evening classes